en.fuller:
λογίζομαι
(λόγος), [in LXX chiefly for חָשַׁב ;]
__1. prop., of numerical calculation, to count, reckon: with accusative before μετά, Mrk.15:23 (LXX) (Rec., R, mg.), Luk.22:37.
__2. Metaphorical, without reference to numbers, by a reckoning of characteristics or reasons;
__(a) to reckon, take into account: with accusative of thing(s), 1Co.13:5; id. before dative of person(s), Rom.4:3 (LXX), Rom.4:4, 6 4:8" (LXX), 2Co.5:19, 2Ti.4:16; before εἰς (cf. Heb. ל חָשַׁב; Bl., § 33, 3), Act.19:27, Rom.2:26 4:3, 5 4:9-11, 22-24 9:8 Gal.3:6" (LXX), Jas.2:23 (LXX);
__(b) to consider, calculate: with accusative of thing(s), Php.4:8; before ὅτι, Jhn.11:50, Heb.11:10; τοῦτο, ὅτι, 2Co.10:11; with accusative of person(s), with inf., Rom.6:11; before ὡς, Rom.8:36 (LXX);
__(with) to suppose, judge, deem: 1Co.13:11; ὡς, 1Pe.5:12; οὕτως, 1Co.4:1; with accusative of thing(s), 2Co.3:5; id. before εἰς, 2Co.12:6; ὅτι, Rom.8:18; τοῦτο, ὅτι, Rom.2:3, 2Co.10:7; with inf., 2Co.11:5; accusative and inf., Rom.3:28 14:14, Php.3:13; with accusative of person(s) before ὡς, 2Co.10:2;
__(d) to purpose, decide: with inf. (Eur., Or., 555), 2Co.10:2
(cf. ἀνα-, δια-, παρα-, συλ-λογίζομαι).†
(AS)

es.fuller:
λογίζομαι
(λόγος), [en LXX princ. for חָשַׁב ;]
1. prop., of numerical calculation, to count, reckon: con acus. before μετά, Mc.15:23 (LXX) (Rec., R, mg.), Lc.22:37.
2. Metaphorical, without reference to numbers, by a reckoning of characteristics or reasons;
(a) to reckon, take into account: con acus. de cosa, 1Co.13:5; id. before dat. of person(s), Ro.4:3 (LXX), Ro.4:4, 6 4:8" (LXX), 2Co.5:19, 2Ti.4:16; before εἰς (cf. heb. ל חָשַׁב; Bl., § 33, 3), Hch.19:27, Ro.2:26 4:3, 5 4:9-11, 22-24 9:8 Gá.3:6" (LXX), Stg.2:23 (LXX);
(b) to consider, calculate: con acus. de cosa, Fil.4:8; before ὅτι, Jn.11:50, Heb.11:10; τοῦτο, ὅτι, 2Co.10:11; con acus. de pers., con inf., Ro.6:11; before ὡς, Ro.8:36 (LXX);
(with) to suppose, judge, deem: 1Co.13:11; ὡς, 1P.5:12; οὕτως, 1Co.4:1; con acus. de cosa, 2Co.3:5; id. before εἰς, 2Co.12:6; ὅτι, Ro.8:18; τοῦτο, ὅτι, Ro.2:3, 2Co.10:7; con inf., 2Co.11:5; acus. and inf., Ro.3:28 14:14, Fil.3:13; con acus. de pers. before ὡς, 2Co.10:2;
(d) to purpose, decide: con inf. (Eur., Or., 555), 2Co.10:2
(cf. ἀνα-, δια-, παρα-, συλ-λογίζομαι).†
(AS)

he.fuller:
λογίζομαι
(λόγος), [בשבעים בעיקר for חָשַׁב ;]
1. בעיקרו, of numerical calculation, to count, reckon: עם ישי׳ before μετά, מרקוס.15:23 (LXX) (Rec., R, mg.), לוקס.22:37.
2. Metaphorical, without reference to numbers, by a reckoning of characteristics or reasons;
(a) to reckon, take into account: עם ישי׳ של דבר, 1קור.13:5; id. before עקיף of person(s), רומים.4:3 (LXX), רומים.4:4, 6 4:8" (LXX), 2קור.5:19, 2טי.4:16; before εἰς (השוו עב׳ ל חָשַׁב; Bl., § 33, 3), מע״ש.19:27, רומים.2:26 4:3, 5 4:9-11, 22-24 9:8 גל.3:6" (LXX), יעק.2:23 (LXX);
(b) to consider, calculate: עם ישי׳ של דבר, פי.4:8; before ὅτι, יוחנן.11:50, עב.11:10; τοῦτο, ὅτι, 2קור.10:11; עם ישי׳ של אדם, עם מקור, רומים.6:11; before ὡς, רומים.8:36 (LXX);
(with) to suppose, judge, deem: 1קור.13:11; ὡς, 1פ.5:12; οὕτως, 1קור.4:1; עם ישי׳ של דבר, 2קור.3:5; id. before εἰς, 2קור.12:6; ὅτι, רומים.8:18; τοῦτο, ὅτι, רומים.2:3, 2קור.10:7; עם מקור, 2קור.11:5; ישי׳ and מקור, רומים.3:28 14:14, פי.3:13; עם ישי׳ של אדם before ὡς, 2קור.10:2;
(d) to purpose, decide: עם מקור (Eur., Or., 555), 2קור.10:2
(השוו ἀνα-, δια-, παρα-, συλ-λογίζομαι).†
(AS)
